                                                    <table>
                                                        <tbody>
                                                            <tr>
                                                                <td>
                                                                    Use this demo to fill the fields of an existing PDF form with the PDF editor, to import the values of a FDF or XFDF file
                                                                    and to export the filled values as FDF. The appearance of the fields can be changed, the fields can be made read-only,
                                                                    hidden, renamed or removed and the options of a choice field can be replaced. The filled fields or all the fields can be
                                                                    flattened to static page content. The page added at the end of the document lists the fields read from the form with
                                                                    their type and value.<br /><br />
                                                                    The sample form is the registration form generated by the Create PDF Forms from Code demo. The field names below
                                                                    refer to it; a field missing from another form is skipped.
